{"version":1,"content":"<p>一份最新披露的採購記錄顯示，中國一所與中國人民解放軍關係密切、同時被列入美國出口管制黑名單的高校，近期獲得了英偉達先進H200人工智能晶片。相關發現再次引發美國政界對高端AI晶片流向中國以及現行出口管制措施有效性的討論。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585894.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T07:14:10.299358+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:54:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:33.884021+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:33.884021+00:00","content_hash":"13cbe1f330768d82267bb55a45042a423822964129b36e4abf4907c7100895a8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}